const List<GeoTopic> historyTopics = <GeoTopic>[
  GeoTopic(
    id: "sultanate",
    title: "Delhi Sultanate: Paanch Khandan",
    subtitle: "Teen sau bees saal, paanch khandan, battis sultan, aur har takht ke peeche aik kahani",
    portion: "history",
    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.heading("Pehle poori tasveer dekh lo"),
      LessonBlock.image("assets/learning/diagrams/history/sultanate-timeline.jpg", caption: "Delhi Sultanate — Five Dynasties, 1206 to 1526"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Dekho, jab bhi Delhi Sultanate ka naam aye to dimagh me aik lambi film samjho. Saal 1206 se saal 1526 tak, pure teen sau bees saal, Delhi ke takht par paanch khandan baithay aur kul battis sultan aye aur gaye. Koi ghulam se uth kar badshah bana, koi aurat takht par baithi aur poora darbar us ke khilaf ho gaya, kisi ne bazaar ke daam bandh diye, kisi ne poora darul hukumat hi utha kar saikron meel door le ja kar phaink diya. Ye sirf tareekhon ki list nahi hai, ye kirdaron ki kahani hai, aur paper me sawal hamesha inhi kirdaron par banta hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Tartib yaad rakhne ki trick pehle zehen me bitha lo. Apni paanch ungliyan dekho. Angutha Ghulaman, us ke baad Khilji, phir Tughlaq, phir Sayyid, aur sab se chhoti ungli par Lodhi. Ghulam, Khilji, Tughlaq, Sayyid, Lodhi. Bas yehi paanch lafz tartib se yaad kar lo, kyunke paper ka pehla phanda yahi hota hai ke konsa khandan pehle aya aur konsa baad me. Aur aik baat aur. Har khandan ke sath us ka dor zehen me jor lo. Ghulaman 1206 se 1290, Khilji 1290 se 1320, Tughlaq 1320 se 1414, Sayyid 1414 se 1451, aur Lodhi 1451 se 1526. Ab aik aik karke andar chalte hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pehla khandan: Khandan e Ghulaman (1206 se 1290)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Is khandan ko Mamluk khandan bhi kehte hain, aur naam hi is ki pehchan hai. Is ke pehle teen sultan kabhi ghulam reh chuke the. Yani takht par wo log baithay jo kabhi bazaar me bikte the. Tareekh me aisa kam hota hai, is liye ye khandan paper ka pasandeeda hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Qutbuddin Aibak (1206 se 1210). Ye Muhammad Ghauri ka ghulam tha, lekin ghulam aisa ke maalik ne use apna sab se bharose ka sipah salar bana diya tha. Ghauri ki wafat ke baad 1206 me Aibak Delhi aur Lahore ke ilaqe ka hukmaran bana, aur yahin se Sultanate ki buniyad pari. Us ka dor sirf chaar saal ka tha, lekin usi chaar saal me us ne wo kaam shuru kiya jo aaj tak khara hai. Delhi me Qutb Minar ki buniyad usi ne rakhi, pehli manzil usi ke dor me bani, baqi kaam Iltutmish ne pura kiya. Aibak apni sakhaawat ki wajah se Lakh Bakhsh kahlaya, yani lakhon dene wala. Kehte hain us ke dar se koi khaali haath nahi lota. Aur us ki maut bhi ajeeb thi. 1210 me Lahore me chaugan, yani polo, khelte hue wo ghore se gira aur chal basa. Lahore hi me us ki qabar hai. Paper me Aibak par teen sawal ghoomte hain: pehla sultan kon tha, Qutb Minar ki buniyad kis ne rakhi, aur Lakh Bakhsh kis ka laqab tha. Teeno ke jawab me Aibak hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Shamsuddin Iltutmish (1211 se 1236). Aibak ke baad us ka ghulam aur damad Iltutmish takht par baitha, aur tareekh dan isay Delhi Sultanate ka asal baani mante hain. Aibak ne buniyad rakhi thi, Iltutmish ne imarat khari ki. Samjho kyun. Us ne baghi sardaron ko kuchla, Mongolon ke toofaan se saltanat ko bachaya, jab Changez Khan aik bhagore shahzade ka peecha karta hua Sindh tak aa gaya to Iltutmish ne baree aqalmandi se us bhagore ko panah dene se inkaar kar diya, aur toofaan tal gaya. Us ne iqta ka nizam chalaya, yani bare bare ilaqe apne afsaron ko is shart par diye ke wo wahan se maal guzari jama karein aur fauj rakhein. Us ne chaandi ka tanka aur taanbe ka jital sikka chalaya, aur ye sikke sadiyon tak Hindustan ki pehchan rahe. Baghdad ke Khalifa se us ne apni hukumat ki sanad, yani manzoori, hasil ki, jis se us ki takht ko mazhabi aur siyasi taqat mili. Qutb Minar ko usi ne mukammal kiya. Aur sab se bari baat, marne se pehle us ne apne beton ko na-ahal samajh kar apni beti Razia ko janashin naamzad kiya. Ye faisla us zamaane ke lihaz se inqilabi tha."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Razia Sultana (1236 se 1240). Hindustan ki tareekh me wo wahid musalman aurat hai jo Delhi ke takht par baithi. Aur ye koi naam ki hukmaran nahi thi. Razia mardon ke libaas me darbar karti, fauj ki qayadat khud karti, ghore par sawaar ho kar jang me jati. Us ki qabiliyat par kisi ko shak nahi tha. Phir zawal kyun aya? Wajah us ki qabiliyat nahi, darbar ki siyaset thi. Turk sardaron ka garoh, jisay Chahalgani yani chaalis ka garoh kehte the, ye bardasht hi nahi kar saka ke aik aurat un par hukmaran ho aur wo ghulam zaade khud ko asl malik samajhte hon. Phir Razia ne aik Habshi ghulam Jamaluddin Yaqut ko bara ohda diya to aag aur bharak uthi. Bhatinda ke governor Altunia ne baghawat ki, Razia haraai gayi, phir us ne Altunia se shadi karke takht wapas lene ki koshish ki, lekin 1240 me Kaithal ke paas wo mari gayi. Paper me Razia par sawal fix hai: Hindustan ki pehli aur akeli musalman aurat hukmaran kon thi, aur us ke zawal ki wajah kya thi. Jawab yaad rakho, wajah na-ahliyat nahi, ameeron ki baghawat thi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ghiyasuddin Balban (1266 se 1287). Razia ke baad kamzor sultanon ka lamba silsila aya, phir takht par wo shakhs baitha jis ka naam sun kar darbar kaanpta tha. Balban khud kabhi ghulam tha, Chahalgani ka rukun tha, aur phir usi garoh ko us ne aik aik karke khatam kar diya taake koi takht ko challenge na kar sake. Us ki policy ko tareekh khoon aur lohe ki policy kehti hai, yani baghawat ho to koi riayat nahi. Us ne badshah ke rutbe ko aam insan se boht buland kar diya. Darbar me sijda, yani badshah ke aage sajda karna, aur paibos, yani badshah ke paon chumna, usi ne lazmi kiya. Us ka nazariya tha ke badshah zameen par Khuda ka saaya hai. Jasoosi ka itna mazboot jaal bichhaya ke har soobe ki khabar us tak pohnchti thi. Us ke dor ka sab se bara khatra Mongol the, jo baar baar sarhad par hamla karte the. Balban ka sab se pyara beta, Shahzada Muhammad, 1285 me Mongolon se larte hue shaheed ho gaya. Kehte hain is gham ne budhe badshah ko tod diya, aur do saal baad 1287 me wo chal basa. Paper me Balban ke teen nukaat sab se zyada dohraye jate hain: sijda o paibos, khoon aur lohe ki policy, aur Mongolon ka muqabla."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Dusra khandan: Khilji (1290 se 1320)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ye khandan sirf tees saal raha, lekin in tees saalon me Delhi Sultanate apni taqat ke urooj par pohnch gayi. Wajah aik hi shakhs tha, Alauddin Khilji."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Jalaluddin Khilji (1290 se 1296). Khandan ka baani aik sattar saal ka budha tha, naram mizaaj, sab ko maaf kar dene wala. Usi neeche us ka bhatija aur damad Alauddin Kara ka governor tha, jo khamoshi se takht ki taraf barh raha tha. Devagiri ki fatah se Alauddin ne itni daulat jama ki ke fauj us ke peeche chal pari. 1296 me Jalaluddin apne bhatije se milne Kara gaya, aur wahan jis garam joshi se wo aage barha, wahin usay qatal kar diya gaya. Ye Sultanate ki tareekh ka wo moor hai jahan mohabbat aur takht ki hawas aamne saamne aati hai, aur hawas jeet jati hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Alauddin Khilji (1296 se 1316). Ab suno is badshah ko gaur se, kyunke one paper ka sab se bara hissa isi par hai. Alauddin woh pehla sultan tha jis ne poora Hindustan fatah karne ka khwab dekha aur takreeban pura bhi kiya. Pehle Mongolon ka masla samjho. Us ke dor me Mongol baar baar hamlaawar hue, aik dafa to Delhi ke darwazon tak aa gaye. Alauddin ne sarhad par qilay mazboot kiye, bari musta'id fauj khari ki, aur Mongolon ko aisi shikastein dein ke unhon ne Hindustan ka rukh karna chor diya. Phir futoohat ka silsila chala. Gujarat fatah hua, Ranthambore ka qila toota, 1303 me Chittor fatah hua jis ke sath Rani Padmini ki kahani juri hui hai. Aur phir us ka sipah salar Malik Kafur janub ki taraf gaya aur Devagiri, Warangal, Dwarasamudra aur Madurai tak Muslim faujon ki ye pehli bari pesh qadmi thi. Yani Alauddin ke dor me saltanat Kashmir ki sarhad se lekar Hindustan ke aakhri janubi kinare tak phail gayi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Lekin Alauddin sirf jangju nahi tha, wo Sultanate ka sab se bara muntazim tha. Us ne bazaar control ka nizam chalaya. Ghalla, kapra, ghore, har cheez ke daam sarkar ne bandh diye. Is ke liye alag mehakma bana, Diwan e Riyasat, aur bazaar ka nigehbaan Shahna e Mandi muqarrar hua. Is nizam ki asal wajah tareekh dan ye batate hain ke kam tankhwah par bari fauj rakhni thi, aur fauj tabhi kam tankhwah par guzara kar sakti thi jab bazaar sasta ho. Us ne fauj me daagh ka nizam chalaya, yani sarkari ghoron par nishan lagaya jata taake sipahi apna kamzor ghora pesh karke dhoka na de, aur huliya nizam me har sipahi ki shakal o surat register me likhi jati. Zameen ki paimaish karwa kar us ne maal guzari ka nizam sakhti se nafiz kiya. Ye teen nukaat, bazaar control, daagh o huliya, aur zameen ki paimaish, paper me Alauddin ke naam ke sath bandhe hue hain, inhein kabhi na bhoolna. Alauddin 1316 me chal basa, aur us ke baad Khilji khandan sirf chaar saal me bikhar gaya."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Teesra khandan: Tughlaq (1320 se 1414)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Tughlaq khandan sab se lamba chala, takreeban chauranwe saal, aur is me Sultanate ke sab se ajeeb kirdar aye. Aik wo sultan jis ne nehrein khudwayein aur sheher basaye, aur aik wo jisay tareekh sab se zyada parha likha aur sab se zyada nakam tajurba kar badshah kehti hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ghiyasuddin Tughlaq (1320 se 1325). Khandan ka baani Ghazi Malik ke naam se mashhoor tha, aik sipahi se uth kar sultan bana. Us ne Delhi ke paas Tughlaqabad ka mazboot qila sheher basaya. 1325 me Bengal ki muham se wapsi par Afghanpur ke maqam par us ke isteqbaal ke liye banaya gaya lakri ka mehal gir gaya aur sultan us ke neeche dab kar chal basa. Kuch tareekh danon ne ye shaq bhi zahir kiya ke ye haadsa nahi, saazish thi, aur ungli us ke bete Muhammad bin Tughlaq ki taraf uthi. Paper ke liye bas itna yaad rakho ke ye waqia aaj tak sawal bana hua hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Muhammad bin Tughlaq (1325 se 1351). Ab is kirdar ko khaas dhyaan se parho. Ye sultan mantiq, falsafa, tib, falakiyat aur khush khati me apne zamaane ke ulama se aage tha. Lekin us ke tajurbe aik aik karke ultay pare, aur har tajurbe ki kahani paper me alag sawal banti hai. Pehla tajurba, darul hukumat ki muntaqili. Us ne faisla kiya ke Delhi ke bajaye Devagiri ko, jis ka naam us ne Daulatabad rakha, darul hukumat banaya jaye, kyunke wo saltanat ke darmiyan me tha aur Mongolon ki zad se door tha. Soch apni jagah durust thi, lekin amal ne awaam ko rulaya. Darbar, daftar aur Delhi ke log saikron meel door janub bheje gaye, raaste me takleefon ka samna hua, phir jab tajurba nakam hua to sab ko wapas Delhi ana para. Dusra tajurba, taanbe ke sikke. Us ne taanbe aur peetal ke sikke ko chaandi ke tanke ke barabar qeemat par chalaya, jisay aaj ki zabaan me token currency kehte hain. Khayal bura nahi tha, lekin sarkar ne sikka banane par apni ijara daari qaim na rakhi. Nateeja ye hua ke har ghar taksaal ban gaya, jaali sikke bazaar me bhar gaye, tijarat thup ho gayi, aur sultan ko sikke wapas lekar khazane se asal chaandi deni pari. Teesra tajurba, Doab me tax. Ganga aur Jamna ke darmiyani zarkhaiz ilaqe me us ne maal guzari barhai, lekin badqismati se unhi saalon me qehat para. Kisan tax na de sake, baghawatein phoot parin, aur sakhti ne aag ko aur hawa di. In tajurbon ke baad tareekh dan Barani ne wo mashhoor jumla likha ke sultan ko awaam se aur awaam ko sultan se nijaat mil gayi. Muhammad bin Tughlaq 1351 me Thatta ke paas baghiyon ka peecha karte hue chal basa."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Firoz Shah Tughlaq (1351 se 1388). Muhammad bin Tughlaq ka chacha zaad bhai takht par baitha to lehja hi badal gaya. Ye jangon ka nahi, falahi kaamon ka badshah tha. Us ne bari nehrein khudwayein jin se khushk ilaqon me kheti shuru hui, Jamna se Hisar tak ki neher us ki pehchan hai. Us ne naye sheher basaye, Delhi me Firozabad, phir Hisar, Fatehabad aur Jaunpur, jo us ne apne marhoom sultan Jauna Khan yani Muhammad bin Tughlaq ki yaad me basaya tha. Gharibon ki madad ke liye Diwan e Khairat banaya, bemaaron ke muft ilaaj ke liye shafa khane khole, berozgaron ko kaam dilane ka daftar banaya. Ashoka ke do pathar ke satoon wo boht ehtiyat se Delhi mangwa kar le gaya, jinhein dekh kar wo hairan hota tha ke ye banaye kis ne honge. Lekin us ke naram nizam ne fauj aur intezaam ko dheela bhi kiya, aur us ki wafat ke baad saltanat tezi se kamzor hoti gayi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Timur ka hamla (1398). Firoz Shah ke baad takht par kamzor naamen beth'te rahe, aur tabhi 1398 me Samarkand ka faateh Amir Timur Hindustan par toofaan ban kar toota. Us waqt naam ke sultan Nasiruddin Mahmud Tughlaq the. Delhi fatah hua, sheher me qatal e aam hua, aur Timur daulat, karigar aur fankaar samait kar wapas chala gaya. Is hamle ne Delhi Sultanate ki kamar tod di. Khandan ka naam 1414 tak chalta raha, lekin taqat kahin pehle khatam ho chuki thi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Chautha khandan: Sayyid (1414 se 1451)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ye sab se chhota aur sab se kamzor dor hai, is liye isay mukhtasar yaad rakho. Khandan ka baani Khizr Khan tha, jo Timur ka muqarrar karda tha. Us ne apne aap ko badshah kahlane ki bajaye Rayat e Aala ka laqab ikhtiyar kiya aur naam ke tor par Timur ke khandan ki hukumat ka numainda bana raha. Is dor me saltanat Delhi aur us ke aas paas ke ilaqon tak simat gayi, soobe aik aik karke azaad ho gaye. Aakhri Sayyid hukmaran Alam Shah itna be-bas tha ke 1451 me wo takht chor kar Badaun chala gaya aur apni baqi zindagi wahi guzari. Paper me Sayyid khandan se bas yahi do sawal bante hain, baani kon tha aur dor itna kamzor kyun tha."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paanchwa khandan: Lodhi (1451 se 1526)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Lodhi Delhi Sultanate ka aakhri khandan tha, aur ye pehla khandan tha jo naslan Afghan yani Pathan tha. Is farq ko samajhna zaroori hai, kyunke Lodhi sultanon ka andaz pehle sultanon se alag tha. Afghan qabaili rawaiye me sardar khud ko badshah ka barabar samajhta tha, aur yahi rawaiya aage chal kar is khandan ke zawal ki wajah bana."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Bahlol Lodhi (1451 se 1489). Khandan ka baani aik tajir zaade se sultan bana. Us ne Jaunpur ko fatah karke saltanat ko dobara wusat di. Lekin us ki asal pehchan us ka rawaiya tha. Wo apne Afghan sardaron ko bhaiyon ki tarah rakhta, un ke sath aik hi qaleen par baithta, aur takht par akela uncha baithne ko apni shaan nahi samajhta tha. Isi rawaiye ne Afghanon ko us ke gird jama rakha."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Sikandar Lodhi (1489 se 1517). Bahlol ka beta is khandan ka sab se qabil sultan tha. 1504 me us ne Agra sheher ki buniyad rakhi aur phir use apna darul hukumat banaya, ye wahi Agra hai jo aage chal kar Mughalon ka garh bana. Zameen ki paimaish ke liye us ne gaz e Sikandari ka paimana chalaya jo sadiyon tak chalta raha. Wo sakht muntazim tha, bazaar ke daam par nazar rakhta, jasusi ka jaal rakhta, aur khud Gulrukhi ke takhallus se shairi bhi karta tha. Lekin aik baat me wo apne baap se mukhtalif tha, wo Afghan sardaron ko barabar ka darja dene ke bajaye unhein darbar ke aadab ka paaband banane laga, aur yahin se takrao ki buniyad pari."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ibrahim Lodhi (1517 se 1526) aur Panipat. Sikandar ka beta takht par baitha to us ne wo jumla kaha jo us ki tabahi ka sabab bana, ke badshahat me koi rishtedari nahi hoti. Us ne purane Afghan sardaron ko zaleel kiya, unhein darbar me khara rakha, kuch ko qaid kiya. Naraz sardaron ne wo qadam uthaya jis ne tareekh badal di. Punjab ke governor Daulat Khan Lodhi aur Ibrahim ke chacha Alam Khan ne Kabul ke hukmaran Babur ko Hindustan par hamle ki daawat de di. 21 April 1526 ko Panipat ke maidan me pehli jang hui. Babur ki fauj taadad me kam thi, lekin us ke paas topein aur bandoqain thein aur us ki jangi hikmat, tulughma, Ibrahim ke bare lashkar par bhari pari. Ibrahim Lodhi maidan e jang me maara gaya. Kehte hain wo Delhi ka wahid sultan tha jo takht bachate hue maidan me kaam aya. Usi din Delhi Sultanate ke teen sau bees saal khatam hue, aur Hindustan me aik nayi saltanat ka pehla din shuru hua, Mughal Saltanat."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aakhir me aik saans me poora khulasa zehen me dohra lo. Ghulaman ne buniyad rakhi, Aibak ne takht sambhala, Iltutmish ne saltanat banayi, Razia ne tareekh rachi, Balban ne khauf se nizam chalaya. Khiljiyon me Alauddin ne saltanat ko urooj diya, futoohat bhi, bazaar control bhi. Tughlaqon me Muhammad bin Tughlaq ke tajurbe ultay pare, Firoz Shah ne nahrein aur sheher diye, aur Timur ne aakar kamar tod di. Sayyid naam ke hukmaran rahe, aur Lodhi Afghanon ke baad Ibrahim ki ana ne Panipat me sab kuch khatam kar diya. Ye tartib aur ye kirdar yaad kar lo, Sultanate ka paper tumhare liye khul jayega."),
    ],
  ),
  GeoTopic(
    id: "mughal",
    title: "Mughal Saltanat (1526 se 1857)",
    subtitle: "Teen sau saal se zyada chalne wali wo saltanat jis ke badshahon ki zindagi khud aik dastaan hai",
    portion: "history",
    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.heading("Pehle poori tasveer dekh lo"),
      LessonBlock.image("assets/learning/diagrams/history/mughal-timeline.jpg", caption: "The Mughals — Babur to Bahadur Shah Zafar"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Panipat ke maidan me jab Babur ki topein garjin to Hindustan me aik nayi saltanat ne janam liya, Mughal Saltanat. 1526 se 1857 tak, teen sau iktees saal. Is me chhe bare badshah aye jinhein tareekh Mughal e Azeem kehti hai: Babur, Humayun, Akbar, Jahangir, Shah Jahan aur Aurangzeb. Phir zawal ka lamba dor aya, aur aakhir me aik budha shair badshah reh gaya jis ke paas Delhi ke Lal Qilay se bahar koi hukumat nahi thi. Har badshah ka kirdar dusre se bilkul mukhtalif hai. Babur jangju aur likhne wala, Humayun khush qismat naam rakh kar bhi badqismat, Akbar nizam banane wala, Jahangir insaaf aur fun ka shaukeen, Shah Jahan imaaraton ka aashiq, aur Aurangzeb sab se taqatwar aur sab se tanha. In chhe kirdaron ko kahani ki tarah samajh lo, Mughal tareekh khud yaad ho jayegi."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Babur (1526 se 1530): Wo badshah jo qalam aur talwaar dono chalata tha"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Zahiruddin Muhammad Babur Farghana ki chhoti si riyasat ka shahzada tha. Baap ki taraf se wo Amir Timur ki nasl se tha aur maa ki taraf se Changez Khan ki, is liye us ki saltanat ko Mughal kaha gaya. Us ki zindagi ka pehla hissa thokron ki kahani hai. Samarkand, jo us ke dada ki saltanat ka dil tha, us ne teen dafa fatah kiya aur teen dafa khoya. Aakhir us ne Kabul ko apna markaz banaya aur nazar Hindustan ki daulat par rakhi. Phir wo daawat ayi jo Lodhi sardaron ne di thi, aur Babur Hindustan aa gaya."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("21 April 1526 ko Panipat ki pehli jang hui. Ibrahim Lodhi ke paas lakh ke qareeb lashkar tha, Babur ke paas mushkil se pachees tees hazar. Lekin Babur ke paas wo cheez thi jo Hindustan ne pehle kabhi maidan e jang me nahi dekhi thi: topein aur bandoqain. Us ne gaariyon ko zanjeeron se bandh kar un ke peeche topain aur bandoqchi khare kiye, aur tulughma hikmat se ghore sawaar dono taraf se ghoom kar dushman ko ghair lete the. Ustad Ali Quli ki topon ne Lodhi lashkar ke haathiyon aur bheerr ko bikher diya. Ibrahim Lodhi maidan me maara gaya aur Delhi Babur ka ho gaya. Paper ka fix sawal yahin se banta hai: Hindustan me maidan e jang me topon ka pehla istemal Panipat 1526 me Babur ne kiya. Us ke baad Babur ne 1527 me Khanwa ke maqam par Rana Sanga ko hara kar Rajput taqat ko roka, Chanderi aur Ghaghra ki jangon se apni hukumat mazboot ki. Babur ki do pehchan aur yaad rakho. Aik, us ne apni aap beeti Tuzuk e Baburi, jisay Baburnama kehte hain, khud Turki zubaan me likhi, aur ye kitaab apni saaf goi ki wajah se duniya ki mashhoor aap beetiyon me gini jati hai. Dusri, usay Kabul se aisi mohabbat thi ke marne ke baad us ki laash Kabul le ja kar us ke pasandeeda bagh me dafnayi gayi. Babur 1530 me Agra me chal basa, yani us ne Hindustan me sirf chaar saal hukumat ki, lekin un chaar saalon ne teen sau saal ki saltanat ki buniyad rakh di."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Humayun (1530 se 1540, phir 1555 se 1556): Badshah jis ka naam khush qismat, qismat na thi"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Babur ka beta Humayun takht par baitha. Naam ka matlab hai khush qismat, lekin tareekh me is se zyada thokarein shayad hi kisi badshah ne khai hon. Wo parha likha, naram dil aur sitara shanaasi ka shaukeen tha, lekin us me baap jaisi sakhti aur fauji samajh nahi thi. Us ka asal dushman Bihar aur Bengal ka Afghan sardar Sher Khan tha, jo aage chal kar Sher Shah Suri bana. 1539 me Chausa aur 1540 me Kannauj ki jangon me Sher Shah ne Humayun ko shikast di, aur badshah apni jaan bacha kar bhaaga. Yahan se us ki pandrah saal ki jalawatni shuru hui. Sindh ke sehra me bhatakte hue Amarkot ke maqam par 1542 me us ke ghar wo beta paida hua jis ka naam Akbar rakha gaya. Humayun Iran gaya, wahan ke Shah Tahmasp se madad li, aur pandrah saal baad 1555 me wo Hindustan wapas aya aur Sirhind ki jang jeet kar Delhi dobara hasil kar liya."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Lekin qismat ne yahan bhi saath na diya. Takht wapas mile hue abhi chhe maah hi hue the ke January 1556 me aik sham wo Delhi me apne kitab khane, Sher Mandal, ki seerhiyon se utar raha tha. Wo sitaaron ka mushahida karke lota tha, azaan ki awaaz ayi to adab se jhukne laga, paon apne choghe me phansa, aur wo seerhiyon se gir gaya. Sar ki chot jaan lewa saabit hui. Us ki behen Gulbadan Begum ne baad me us ki zindagi par Humayun Nama likhi, jo is dor ki sab se qeemti kitaab hai. Paper ke liye Humayun ka khulasa aik jumle me band kar lo: takht Sher Shah se haara, pandrah saal jalawatni, wapas aya, aur kitab khane ki seerhiyon se gir kar wafat pai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Darmiyan ka mehmaan: Sher Shah Suri (1540 se 1545)"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab ye baat zehen me saaf kar lo ke Babur se Akbar tak ki kahani me darmiyan me paanch saal aise hain jab Delhi par Mughal nahi, aik Afghan badshah tha, Sher Shah Suri. Aur ye paanch saal itne aham hain ke Akbar ke nizam ki aadhi buniyad Sher Shah ne rakhi thi. Asal naam Farid Khan tha. Kehte hain Bihar me us ne akele nehar, yani sher, ko maar giraya tha, tabhi se wo Sher Khan kahlaya. Us ne pehle Chausa aur Kannauj me Humayun ko haraya aur phir takht par baith kar wo intezami nizam chalaya jo aaj bhi kitaabon me parhaya jata hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Us ke karnaame gin lo. Us ne Peshawar se Bengal tak Sadak e Azam banayi, jisay aaj GT Road yani Grand Trunk Road kehte hain. Ye sirf sarak nahi thi, is ke kinare sarayen thein jahan musafir thehar sake, dak ke ghore badle jate the, aur yun poori saltanat me khabron aur dak ka jaal bich gaya. Aaj ki dak ki tarah samjho, bas ghore us ke harakaray the. Us ne chaandi ka rupiya sikka chalaya, aur ye lafz rupiya aaj tak hamari currency ki pehchan hai. Zameen ki paimaish karwa kar kisan ko patta diya aur maal guzari ka wazeh nizam banaya, jo baad me Akbar ne apna liya. Us ne Rohtas ka qila banwaya, Delhi me Purana Qila mukammal kiya, aur Bihar ke Sasaram me aik jheel ke darmiyan apna maqbara banwaya jo apni khubsurti me Taj Mahal ka pesh ro kaha jata hai. Sher Shah 1545 me Kalinjar ke muhasre ke dauraan barood ke dhamake me chal basa. Sirf paanch saal ki hukumat, lekin nizam aisa ke aane wale badshah usi par chalte rahe. Paper me Sher Shah par sawal hamesha us ke nizam par banta hai: GT Road, dak ka nizam, rupiya, aur Sasaram ka maqbara."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Akbar (1556 se 1605): Wo badshah jis ne saltanat ko nizam bana diya"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Humayun ki wafat ke waqt us ka beta Akbar sirf terah saal ka tha aur Punjab me apne ataleeq Bairam Khan ke saath tha. Kalanaur ke maqam par us ki tajposhi hui. Us saal Delhi par Hemu ne qabza kar liya tha, jo aik Hindu sardar tha aur apne aap ko badshah samajhta tha. 5 November 1556 ko Panipat ki dusri jang hui. Bairam Khan ki qayadat me Mughal fauj ne Hemu ko hara diya, Hemu ki aankh me teer laga aur jang ka naqsha palat gaya. Yahan se Akbar ka asal dor shuru hua, jo unanchaas saal chala aur Mughal Saltanat ko us ki asal shakal di."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Akbar ki sab se bari kamyabi us ki Rajput policy thi. Us ne samajh liya tha ke Hindustan par hukumat Rajputon ko dushman bana kar nahi, dost bana kar ho sakti hai. Us ne Amber ke Raja Bharmal ki beti se shadi ki, Rajput sardaron ko fauj aur darbar me sab se bare ohde diye, Raja Man Singh us ka sab se bharose ka sipah salar bana. Mazhabi rawadari me wo apne zamaane se boht aage tha. Us ne ghair Muslimon par laga jizya tax khatam kar diya, teerath yatra ka tax maaf kiya, aur us ki policy ko sulh e kul kehte hain, yani sab ke saath aman. Fatehpur Sikri ka sheher us ne basaya, jahan Gujarat ki fatah ki yaad me Buland Darwaza banaya gaya, jo aaj bhi Hindustan ke sab se buland darwazon me hai. Wahi Ibadat Khana bana jahan pehle musalman ulama behes karte the, phir Akbar ne Hindu, Jain, Parsi aur Esai mazahib ke alimon ko bhi bula liya. Isi mahaul me 1582 me Din e Ilahi ka elaan hua, jis par kuch tareekh danon ne sakht tanqeed ki ke ye badshah ki siyasi hikmat thi ya mazhab se doori, aur ye tanqeedi zawiya paper me bhi ata hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Intezaam me Akbar ne mansabdari nizam chalaya, jis me har ameer ka darja zaat aur sawaar ki tadaad se tay hota tha. Maal guzari me us ke wazeer Raja Todar Mal ne zabt ka nizam banaya, jis me zameen naapi jati, das saal ki ausat paidawaar par tax tay hota, is liye use dahsaala nizam bhi kehte hain. Us ke darbar ke no mashhoor ratan, jinhein navaratna kehte hain, paper ka fix sawal hain. Birbal apni hazir jawabi ke liye, Todar Mal maal guzari ke liye, Abul Fazl apni kitaab Ain e Akbari aur Akbarnama ke liye, aur Tansen sangeet ke liye sab se zyada poochay jate hain. Un ke ilawa Faizi, Abdur Rahim Khan e Khana, Raja Man Singh, Mulla Do Piyaza aur Faqir Aziao Din bhi is fehrist me ginay jate hain. Akbar ke dor me saltanat Kabul se Bengal aur Kashmir se Deccan tak phaili. 1605 me wo chal basa aur Agra ke paas Sikandra me dafan hua."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Jahangir (1605 se 1627): Insaaf ki zanjeer aur Noor Jahan ka dor"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Akbar ka beta Salim, Jahangir ke naam se takht par baitha. Us ne apne dor ke aaghaz me Agra ke qilay se Jamna ke kinare tak insaaf ki zanjeer lagwayi, jis me ghantiyan bandhi thein. Koi bhi mazloom wo zanjeer hila kar badshah tak apni faryaad pohncha sakta tha. Ye zanjeer us ke insaaf pasandi ki alamat ban gayi aur paper me aksar poochi jati hai. Lekin Jahangir ke dor ki asal kahani us ki begum Noor Jahan hai. Us ka asal naam Mehrunnisa tha, aur 1611 me shadi ke baad wo itni taqatwar hui ke sarkari farmano par us ke dastakhat hone lage, sikkon par us ka naam aya, aur shikar aur siyaset dono me us ka koi saani nahi tha. Tareekh dan is dor ko Noor Jahan ke asar ka dor kehte hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Jahangir hi ke dor me angrez Hindustan ke darwaze par dastak dene lage. Pehle Captain Hawkins aya, phir 1615 me England ke badshah James Awwal ka safeer Sir Thomas Roe Jahangir ke darbar me pohncha aur tijarat ki ijazat hasil karne me kamyab hua. Yahi wo chhoti si shuruaat thi jo aage chal kar East India Company aur phir angrez hukumat ki surat me nikli, is liye ye saal paper me khaas ahamiyat rakhta hai. Jahangir ne apni aap beeti Tuzuk e Jahangiri khud likhi, aur usay tasveer kashi yani painting se gehra lagao tha, us ke dor me Mughal musawwari apne urooj par thi. 1627 me wo chal basa aur Lahore ke paas Shahdara me dafan hua."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Shah Jahan (1628 se 1658): Imaraton ka badshah aur takht ki jang"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Jahangir ka beta Khurram, Shah Jahan ke naam se takht par baitha, aur us ka dor Mughal Saltanat ka sunehra dor kahlata hai, khaas taur par tameeron ki wajah se. Us ki mehboob begum Mumtaz Mahal 1631 me chal basi, aur us ki yaad me Shah Jahan ne Agra me Jamna ke kinare wo imarat banwayi jisay duniya Taj Mahal ke naam se janti hai. Safed sang e marmar ki ye imarat bees hazar karigaron ne baais saal me mukammal ki, aur is ke naqshay ke liye Ustad Ahmad Lahori ka naam sab se mashhoor hai. Isi dor me Delhi ko dobara darul hukumat banaya gaya, wahan Lal Qila aur Hindustan ki sab se bari masjidon me se aik Jama Masjid bani. Aur badshah ke baithne ke liye Takht e Taus, yani mor wala takht, tayyar hua jo apne jawahiraat ki wajah se duniya bhar me mashhoor tha. Ye sab imaaratein paper me Shah Jahan ke naam ke sath bandhi hui hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Lekin is chamakte dor ka anjaam khoon se bhara tha. 1657 me Shah Jahan bemar para to us ke chaar beton me takht ki jang chhir gayi. Sab se bara Dara Shikoh baap ka pasandeeda aur waliahd tha, rawadaar mizaaj ka tha aur us ne mazahib ke taqabul par kaam kiya tha. Dusri taraf Aurangzeb tha, tajurba kaar sipahi aur sakht mizaaj. 1658 me Samugarh ki jang me Aurangzeb ne Dara ko shikast di, Dara giraftar hua aur 1659 me use qatal kar diya gaya. Shah Jahan ko Agra ke qilay me nazarband kar diya gaya, jahan se wo Jamna ke paar Taj Mahal ko dekhta rehta tha. Aath saal ki qaid ke baad 1666 me wo chal basa, aur usay usi Taj Mahal me Mumtaz ke pehlu me dafan kiya gaya jisay us ne mohabbat ki nishani banaya tha. Kahani ka ye mod zaroor yaad rakho: takht ki hawas ne baap ko qaid aur bhai ko qatal tak pohncha diya."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Aurangzeb Alamgir (1658 se 1707): Sab se bari saltanat, sab se lamba dor, sab se tanha badshah"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aurangzeb ka dor unanchaas saal chala, jo tamam Mughal badshahon me sab se lamba hai. Us ke dor me Mughal Saltanat apni sab se bari wusat ko pohnchi. Kabul se Bengal aur Kashmir se Deccan ke aakhri hison tak, takreeban poora Barray Sagheer us ke qabze me tha. Lekin ye wusat usay boht mehngi pari. Apni zindagi ke aakhri pachees saal us ne Deccan me guzare. Wahan Bijapur aur Golconda ki saltanatein us ne fatah kar lein, lekin Marathaon ke khilaf jang khatam hone ka naam nahi leti thi. Shivaji ke baad us ke bete Sambhaji ko Aurangzeb ne qatal karwaya, magar Maratha chhapamar jang paharon aur qilon me jaari rahi aur Mughal khazana aur fauj is lambi jang me ghis'te rahe."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aurangzeb apne dada Akbar se mazhabi policy me bilkul mukhtalif tha. Us ne 1679 me jizya dobara nafiz kiya, jo paper ka boht mashhoor sawal hai. Zaati zindagi me wo apne khandan ka sab se saada aur parhezgar badshah tha. Riwayat hai ke wo apne kharche ke liye khud topiyan seeta aur Quran e Pak ke nuskhe likhta tha, aur sarkari khazane se apne liye kuch nahi leta tha. Us ki wasiyat thi ke usay khuli qabar me dafnaya jaye, aur 1707 me Ahmednagar me wafat ke baad usay Aurangabad ke paas Khuldabad me aik saadi si qabar me dafan kiya gaya. Socho zara, jis badshah ke paas Hindustan ki sab se bari saltanat thi, us ki qabar sab se saadi hai. Lekin us ki sakhtiyon aur lambi Deccan muham ne saltanat ko andar se khokhla kar diya tha. Rajput, Sikh, Jat aur Maratha quwwatein ubhar rahi thein, aur jaise hi us ki aankh band hui, imarat girne lagi."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Zawal aur aakhri badshah: Jab saltanat sirf naam ki reh gayi"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aurangzeb ke baad jo badshah aye, wo saltanat ke wazan ko sambhal hi nahi sakte the. Takht par naam ke badshah baithte rahe aur asal taqat darbar ke ameeron ke haath me chali gayi, aik dor to aisa aya ke do bhai, jinhein Sayyid bandhu kehte hain, badshah banane aur girane wale ban gaye. Soobe aik aik karke azaad hote gaye, Bengal, Awadh aur Hyderabad ke nawab apni apni riyasaton ke malik ban gaye. Maratha taqat Deccan se nikal kar Delhi ke darwaze tak aan pohnchi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Phir 1739 me Iran ka faateh Nadir Shah Durrani Hindustan par hamlaawar hua. Karnal ki jang me Mughal fauj hari, Delhi me qatal e aam hua, aur Nadir Shah jate hue Takht e Taus aur duniya ka mashhoor heera Koh e Noor apne sath le gaya. Us ke baad Ahmad Shah Abdali ke hamle baar baar hue, aur 1761 me Panipat ki teesri jang me us ne Marathaon ko shikast di, lekin is sab ka faida uthaya teesri taqat ne, angrezon ne. 1757 me Plassey aur 1764 me Buxar ki jangon ke baad asal taqat East India Company ke haath me chali gayi aur Mughal badshah un ki tankhwah par guzara karne wala naam ka badshah reh gaya."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aakhri badshah Bahadur Shah Zafar tha, jo 1837 me takht par baitha. Wo badshah kam aur shair zyada tha, Zafar us ka takhallus tha. Us ki hukumat Lal Qilay ki chaar deewari tak mehdood thi. 1857 me jab angrezon ke khilaf Jang e Azaadi bhadki to sipahiyon ne usay apna rehnuma bana liya. Jang nakam hui, angrezon ne Delhi dobara fatah kiya, Zafar ke bete aur pote sar e aam qatal kiye gaye, aur budhe badshah ko muqadma chala kar Burma ke sheher Rangoon jalawatan kar diya gaya. 1862 me wahi us ki wafat hui aur wahi wo dafan hai. Us ka mashhoor sher is poori kahani ka khulasa hai: lagta nahi hai dil mera ujre dayar me. Teen sau saal pehle jo saltanat Babur ki topon se shuru hui thi, wo aik shair badshah ke aansuon par khatam hui."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aakhir me aik saans me poori Mughal tartib dohra lo. Babur ne Panipat me topon se saltanat ki buniyad rakhi. Humayun takht kho kar pandrah saal baad wapas laya, aur darmiyan me Sher Shah Suri ne wo nizam banaya jis par baad ki saltanatein chalin. Akbar ne Rajput dosti, mansabdari aur sulh e kul se saltanat ko imarat banaya. Jahangir ke dor me Noor Jahan ka asar raha aur angrez darwaze par aye. Shah Jahan ne Taj Mahal se dor ko chamkaya lekin takht ki jang me qaid hua. Aurangzeb ne saltanat sab se bari ki lekin Deccan ki lambi jang ne usay khokhla kar diya. Phir kamzor badshah, Nadir Shah aur Abdali ke hamle, angrezon ki taqat, aur aakhir me Bahadur Shah Zafar Rangoon ki qabar. Ye tartib aur har badshah ki aik pehchan yaad kar lo, Mughal tareekh ka paper tum se kabhi nahi uljhega."),
    ],
  ),
  GeoTopic(
    id: "wars-712-1947",
    title: "History: Barre-Sagheer ki Mashhoor Jangain (712 se 1947 tak)",
    subtitle: "Har jang aik kahani hai. Wajah, maidan, salar, aur wo aik lamha jis ne sab badal diya",
    portion: "history",
    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.heading("Ye hisa kyun zaroori hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("One paper aur PPSC ke har test me tareekh ke sawalat ka aik bara hissa jangon se ata hai. Kabhi poocha jata hai ke Panipat ki pehli jang kab hui, kabhi poocha jata hai ke Plassey ki jang me ghadari kis ne ki, aur kabhi sirf ye ke 1857 ki jang ke baad hukumat kis ke paas chali gayi. Masla ye hai ke aksar students sirf saal rat lete hain, aur paper me jab do jangon ke naam mila kar options diye jate hain to wo confuse ho jate hain. Is liye hum har jang ko aik kahani ki tarah parhenge. Pehle wajah, ke jang hui kyun. Phir maidan, ke larai kahan hui. Phir salar, ke dono taraf fouj ki qiyadat kis ke haath me thi. Aur phir wo aik lamha, jis ne poori jang ka rukh badal diya. Jab kahani zehen me beth jayegi to saal khud ba khud yaad ho jayega, kyunke kahani bhoolti nahi, ratta bhool jata hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aik usool pehle samajh lo. Barre-sagheer ki tareekh me kuch jangain itni aham hain ke unhon ne poori saltanat ka naqsha badal diya. 712 me Sindh ka darwaza khula, 1192 me Delhi ka takht badla, 1526 me Mughal aye, 1757 me Angrez ki buniyad pari, aur 1857 me pura nizam palat gaya. In paanch ko to tum neend me bhi pehchan lo, baqi in ke darmiyan ki karriyan hain."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Muhammad bin Qasim aur Sindh ki fatah, 712"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Kahani yun shuru hoti hai. Arab taajiron ka aik jahaaz Debal ke paas samandari daakuon ne loot liya, aur us me kuch musalman khawateen bhi qaidi bana li gayin. Ye khabar Baghdad ke governor Hajjaj bin Yousuf tak pohnchi. Hajjaj ne Sindh ke raja, Raja Dahir, se mutalba kiya ke lutere pakar kar do aur maal wapas karo. Dahir ne jawab diya ke wo ilaqa us ke ikhtiyar me nahi. Yehi inkaar jang ki wajah ban gaya. Hajjaj ne apne bhanje aur damad, Muhammad bin Qasim ko, fouj de kar rawana kiya. Aur suno, us waqt Muhammad bin Qasim ki umar sirf satrah saal thi. Paper me ye umar wala sawal bohat ata hai, isay khaas yaad rakho."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Muhammad bin Qasim pehle Debal pohncha, jo aj ke Karachi ke qareeb aik bandargah thi. Wahan qila fatah hua, phir wo aage barhta gaya. Nirunkot, phir Sehwan, aur aakhir me Darya-e-Sindh ke kinare wo muqabla hua jis ka sab ko intezaar tha. Raja Dahir apne haathi par sawaar ho kar lara, lekin teer lagne se haathi badhak gaya aur raja maidaan me maara gaya. Is ke baad Aror, jo us waqt Sindh ka dar-ul-hukumat tha, fatah ho gaya, aur phir Multan tak ilaqa musalmanon ke paas aa gaya."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Nateeja ye nikla ke Islam barre-sagheer me daakhil ho gaya, aur isi liye Sindh ko Bab-ul-Islam, yani Islam ka darwaza, kaha jata hai. Ye lafz paper ka pasandida hai. Muhammad bin Qasim ne maqami logon ke sath narmi ka sulook kiya, mandiron ko aman diya, aur intezam aisa qayam kiya ke logon ne use qabool kar liya. Aik satrah saala salar ne aik poori tehzeeb ka darwaza khol diya tha, yehi is kahani ka asal nukta hai."),
      LessonBlock.image("assets/learning/diagrams/history/sindh-712.jpg", caption: "Map — Sindh, land of the 712 campaign"),
      LessonBlock.heading("Tarain ki dusri jang, 1192"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Is jang ko samajhne ke liye pehle aik saal peeche jana hoga. 1191 me Tarain ke maidan me hi Shahabuddin Muhammad Ghauri aur Delhi aur Ajmer ke raja Prithviraj Chauhan ka pehla muqabla hua tha, aur us me Ghauri ko shikast hui thi. Wo zakhmi ho kar wapas gaya. Paper me aksar pehli aur dusri Tarain ko mila kar confuse kiya jata hai, is liye ye jumla zehen me bitha lo: 1191 me Ghauri hara, 1192 me Ghauri jeeta."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ghauri ne shikast ko bhoolne ke bajaye us se seekha. Aik saal tayyari ki, aik bari fouj banayi, aur 1192 me dobara Tarain ke maidan me aa khara hua. Tarain ka maidan aj ke Haryana me Thanesar ke qareeb hai. Is dafa Ghauri ne chaal badli. Us ne apni fouj ko hison me taqseem kiya, teer andaz dastay aage peeche hote rahe, aur din bhar ki larai ke baad aakhir me taza dam dastay ne wo hamla kiya jis ke saamne Rajput fouj thehar na saki. Prithviraj pakra gaya aur maara gaya."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Nateeja tareekh badal dene wala tha. Is jeet ke baad Delhi aur Ajmer musalmanon ke paas aa gaye, aur barre-sagheer me musalman hukumat ki wo buniyad pari jo phir sadion chali. Ghauri ne apne ghulam aur sab se bharosay wale salar, Qutbuddin Aibak ko, hindustan ke fatah shuda ilaqon ka nigehbaan banaya. Aur yaad rakho, yehi Aibak baad me 1206 me Delhi Sultanate ka pehla badshah bana. To Tarain ki dusri jang sirf aik jang nahi thi, ye aik nayi saltanat ka pehla din tha."),
      LessonBlock.image("assets/learning/diagrams/history/battle-tarain.jpg", caption: "Map — Tarain, near Karnal"),
      LessonBlock.heading("Panipat ki pehli jang, 1526"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Panipat ka naam yaad kar lo, kyunke is aik maidan me barre-sagheer ki teen sab se bari jangain hui hain. Pehli jang 21 April 1526 ko hui. Aik taraf Kabul ka hukmaran Zaheeruddin Muhammad Babur tha, aur dusri taraf Delhi ka sultan Ibrahim Lodhi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Wajah ye thi ke Babur ki nazar hamesha Hindustan par thi. Wo Timur aur Changez Khan ki nasl se tha aur Delhi ke takht ko apna haq samajhta tha. Idhar Punjab ke governor Daulat Khan Lodhi aur doosre ameer Ibrahim Lodhi se naraaz the aur unhon ne Babur ko dawat di ke aa kar takht sambhalo. Babur aisi dawat ka intezaar hi kar raha tha."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab tadaad suno, kyunke yehi is jang ka sab se hairan kun hissa hai. Babur ke paas sirf bara hazaar ke qareeb fouj thi, aur Ibrahim Lodhi ke paas aik lakh ke qareeb sipahi aur hazaar ke qareeb haathi the. Lekin Babur ke paas do cheezain aisi thi jo Lodhi ke paas nahi thi. Pehli, top aur bandooq, jo hindustan ke maidan me pehli dafa is tarah istemal hui. Dusri, tulughma chaal, jis me ghud sawaar dastay dono taraf se ghoom kar dushman ko peeche se gher lete hain. Babur ne apni topain gaarion ki qatar ke peeche chupai, aur jab Lodhi ki dev-haikal fouj aage barhi to topain garjin, haathi badhak kar apni hi fouj ko kuchalne lage, aur ghud sawaar dono taraf se gherao kar chuke the. Aadhe din ki larai me Ibrahim Lodhi maidan me maara gaya aur us ki fouj bikhar gayi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Nateeja ye hua ke Delhi aur Agra Babur ke paas aa gaye aur Mughal saltanat ki buniyad par gayi. Paper wali khaas baat ye hai ke top ka faisla kun istemal aur tulughma chaal, ye dono alfaaz isi jang ke sath jure hain. Jab bhi sawal aye ke kam fouj ne bari fouj ko kesay haraya, jawab Babur ki top aur us ki chaal hai."),
      LessonBlock.image("assets/learning/diagrams/history/battle-panipat.jpg", caption: "Map — Panipat"),
      LessonBlock.heading("Panipat ki dusri jang, 1556"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Tees saal baad Panipat ke usi maidan me dusri jang hui, 5 November 1556 ko. Lekin is dafa kahani thori si mukhtalif hai. Babur ka pota Akbar us waqt sirf terah saal ka tha aur takht par naya naya betha tha. Asal taqat us ke ataleeq aur salar, Bairam Khan ke haath me thi. Dusri taraf Hemu tha, jo aik hindu wazir aur tajir se uth kar Delhi ka takht jeet chuka tha aur khud ko raja elaan kar chuka tha. Us ke paas bari fouj aur pandrah sau ke qareeb haathi the."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Larai zor ki hui aur aik lamhe ko laga ke jeet Hemu ki hogi, kyunke us ki fouj Mughalon ko daba rahi thi. Phir wo aik lamha aya jis ne tareekh badal di. Aik teer seedha Hemu ki ankh me laga. Wo behosh ho kar haathi se girne laga, aur jaise hi fouj ne apne salar ko girta dekha, us ke hosle toot gaye. Fouj salar ke baghair maidan me theharti nahi, ye jang ka purana usool hai. Hemu pakra gaya aur qatal kar diya gaya."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Nateeja ye hua ke Delhi aur Agra dobara Mughalon ke paas aa gaye, aur Akbar ki wo lambi hukumat shuru hui jo phir adhi sadi chali aur Mughal saltanat ko urooj par pohncha gayi. Paper me is jang ke sath hamesha do naam ate hain, Akbar aur Bairam Khan, aur jeet ki wajah ke tor par Hemu ki ankh me teer lagna. Teenon baatain aik sath yaad rakho."),
      LessonBlock.image("assets/learning/diagrams/history/battle-panipat.jpg", caption: "Map — Panipat"),
      LessonBlock.heading("Sher Shah Suri, wo karri jo do jangon ko jorti hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Panipat ki dusri jang se pehle aik chhota sa waqfa samajh lo, kyunke paper me ye sawal bhi ata hai. Babur ke bete Humayun ko aik afghan salar, Sher Khan ne, jo baad me Sher Shah Suri kehlaya, Chausa 1539 aur phir Kannauj 1540 ki jangon me hara kar Hindustan se nikal diya tha. Sher Shah ne sirf paanch saal hukumat ki, lekin is arse me us ne wo intezami nizam banaya jis par baad me Akbar ne apni saltanat khari ki. GT Road, jo us waqt Peshawar se Calcutta tak bani aur aj bhi maujood hai, daak ka nizam, aur rupiya naam ka sikka, ye sab Sher Shah ki den hain. Humayun pandrah saal baad wapas aya aur takht dobara jeeta, lekin us ke baad jald hi us ki wafat ho gayi aur terah saala Akbar takht par betha. Yehi wo pas-e-manzar hai jis se Panipat ki dusri jang samajh ati hai. To yaad rakho, Babur ne saltanat banayi, Sher Shah ne nizam banaya, aur Akbar ne dono ko mila kar saltanat ko urooj diya."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Plassey ki jang, 1757"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab kahani us mor par ati hai jahan talwaar se zyada sazish kaam karti hai. 23 June 1757 ko Bengal ke aik aam ke bagh wale maidan, Plassey me, East India Company ke salar Robert Clive aur Bengal ke nawab Siraj-ud-Daula ka muqabla hua."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Wajah ye thi ke naujawan nawab Siraj-ud-Daula company ki badhti hui man mani se tang tha. Company Calcutta me us ki ijazat ke baghair qila bandi kar rahi thi aur tijarati riayaton ka galat istemal kar rahi thi. Nawab ne Calcutta par hamla kar ke qila fatah kar liya, aur jawab me Clive Madras se fouj le kar aa pohncha."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Lekin asal kahani maidan se pehle likhi ja chuki thi. Nawab ke sab se bare salar, Mir Jafar ne, Clive se khufiya muahida kar liya tha ke wo jang me hissa nahi lega aur badle me use Bengal ki nawabi milegi. Nateeja ye hua ke nawab ki takreeban pachaas hazaar fouj ke saamne Clive ke sirf teen hazaar ke qareeb sipahi the, lekin jab larai shuru hui to Mir Jafar ka bara hissa khara dekhta raha. Kuch hi golon ki bochar aur nawab ke wafadar salar Mir Madan ki shahadat ke baad nawab maidan chor gaya. Plassey is liye kehte hain ke ye jang kam aur sazish zyada thi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Nateeja ye nikla ke Bengal, jo us waqt hindustan ka sab se ameer suba tha, amalan company ke qabze me chala gaya, aur Mir Jafar kath putli nawab ban gaya. Paper wali khaas baat zehen me rakho: Plassey 1757 me hui, Clive jeeta, aur jeet ki wajah fouji taqat nahi, Mir Jafar ki ghadari thi. Yehi wo buniyad hai jis par phir do sau saal ki angrez hukumat khari hui."),
      LessonBlock.image("assets/learning/diagrams/history/battle-plassey.jpg", caption: "Map — Plassey on the Bhagirathi"),
      LessonBlock.heading("Panipat ki teesri jang, 1761"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab teesri dafa Panipat. 14 January 1761. Ye barre-sagheer ki sab se khoon-raiz jangon me gini jati hai. Aik taraf Afghanistan ka badshah Ahmad Shah Abdali tha, jise Durrani bhi kehte hain, aur dusri taraf Maratha, jo us waqt hindustan ki sab se bari taqat ban chuke the aur un ki fouj Sadashivrao Bhau ki qiyadat me Delhi tak aa pohnchi thi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Wajah ye thi ke Maratha shimal ki taraf barhte barhte Punjab tak aa gaye the, jo Abdali apna ilaqa samajhta tha. Abdali nauvi dafa hindustan aya aur dono foujain Panipat ke maidan me khaimay daal kar beth gayin. Maheenon muhasra raha, Maratha fouj ke sath aye lakhon ghair fouji logon ki wajah se raashan khatam hone laga, aur bhook ne Marathon ko maidan me nikalne par majboor kar diya. 14 January ko wo azeem takrao hua jo subah se dopahar tak jari raha. Pehle Maratha dabao me rahe, lekin phir Abdali ke mehfooz taza dastay maidan me utre aur Maratha fouj toot gayi. Bhau aur peshwa ka beta Vishwasrao dono mare gaye, aur hazaron sipahi aik din me kaam aye."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Nateeja bara talkh tha. Maratha taqat ka wo zor toot gaya jo kabhi wapas na aya, aur peshwa Balaji Baji Rao is sadme se kuch hi maheenon me chal basa. Lekin mazay ki baat ye hai ke Abdali bhi is jeet ka faida utha kar hindustan par hukumat na kar saka, wo wapas chala gaya. Khali hone wali jagah ko bharne ke liye ab sirf aik taqat bachi thi, aur wo thi East India Company. To teesri Panipat ne jeetne wale ko bhi kuch na diya aur harne wale ko sab kuch se mehroom kar diya, aur asal faida teesri taqat utha le gayi. Paper me is jang ki pehchan yehi hai, Maratha taqat ka ikhtitam."),
      LessonBlock.image("assets/learning/diagrams/history/battle-panipat.jpg", caption: "Map — Panipat"),
      LessonBlock.heading("Buxar ki jang, 1764"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Plassey ke saat saal baad, 22 October 1764 ko Buxar ke maidan me wo jang hui jis ne Plassey ki jeet ko pakka kar diya. Is dafa company ke saamne aik nahi, teen taqatoun ka ittehad tha. Bengal ka sabiq nawab Mir Qasim, jo company ki kath putli banne se inkar kar chuka tha. Awadh ka nawab Shuja-ud-Daula. Aur khud Mughal badshah Shah Alam Doum. Company ki fouj ki qiyadat Major Hector Munro ke paas thi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Muqabla sakht hua, lekin company ki tarbiyat yafta fouj aur behtar top khana ittehad ki bari magar ghair munazzam fouj par bhaari para. Teenon hukumraan shikast kha gaye. Phir 1765 me Allahabad ka muahida hua, jis ke tehat Shah Alam Doum ne company ko Bengal, Bihar aur Orissa ki diwani de di. Diwani ka matlab hai maal guzari, yani tax wasool karne ka haq. Samjho ke is aik dastakhat se company taajir se hukmaran ban gayi, kyunke jang jeetna aik baat hai aur tax wasoolne ka qanuni haq milna bilkul dusri baat hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper me Plassey aur Buxar ko aksar mila kar poocha jata hai, to farq is tarah yaad rakho. Plassey 1757, sazish se Bengal mila. Buxar 1764, maidan ki jeet se diwani mili. Pehli ne darwaza khola, dusri ne ghar par qabza pakka kiya."),
      LessonBlock.image("assets/learning/diagrams/history/battle-buxar.jpg", caption: "Map — Buxar on the Ganga"),
      LessonBlock.heading("Mysore ki jangain aur Tipu Sultan, 1767 se 1799"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Shimal se ab dakkan ki taraf chalo. Wahan company ko apne sab se sakht dushman ka saamna tha, Mysore ki saltanat. Pehle Haider Ali aur phir un ke bete Tipu Sultan ne company se chaar jangain larrien, jinhe Anglo-Mysore jangain kehte hain. Pehli do jangon me Haider Ali ne company ko sakht takkar di aur aik dafa to us ki fouj Madras ki deewaron tak pohnch gayi thi. 1782 me dusri jang ke darmiyan Haider Ali ka inteqal ho gaya aur kamaan Tipu Sultan ke haath ayi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Tipu Sultan woh hukmaran tha jis ne angrez ko apna sab se bara dushman samjha aur zindagi bhar us se samjhota karne se inkar kiya. Us ne France se madad lene ki koshish ki, apni fouj ko jadeed tarbiyat di, aur raaketon ka istemal kia jo us daur ki jadeed technology thi. Teesri jang me use apni adhi saltanat aur bhari tawan se haath dhona para. Chauthi jang 1799 me hui. Company ne Nizam aur Marathaon ko sath mila liya tha, aur fouj ne Mysore ke dar-ul-hukumat Seringapatam ka muhasra kar liya. 4 May 1799 ko qile ki deewar tooti aur aakhri hamla hua. Tipu Sultan qile ke darwaze par larte hue shaheed hue. Riwayat hai ke un ka mashhoor jumla tha ke geedar ki sau saala zindagi se sher ki aik din ki zindagi behtar hai. Paper me ye jumla isi tarah riwayat ke tor par poocha jata hai, isay yaad rakho lekin ye bhi yaad rakho ke ye riwayat hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Nateeja ye hua ke Mysore ki saltanat khatam ho gayi aur dakkan me company ki taqat ko rokne wala koi na raha. Paper wali khaas baat: Tipu Sultan 1799 me Seringapatam me shaheed hue, aur unhe Mysore ka sher kaha jata hai."),
      LessonBlock.image("assets/learning/diagrams/history/battle-seringapatam.jpg", caption: "Map — Seringapatam, near Mysuru"),
      LessonBlock.heading("Anglo-Sikh jangain aur Punjab ka qabza, 1845 se 1849"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab aakhri bari taqat ki baat karte hain jo company ke raaste me khari thi, Punjab ki Sikh saltanat. Maharaja Ranjit Singh ne apni zindagi me company se dostana taluqat rakhe aur Sutlej darya ko dono ke darmiyan sarhad mana gaya tha. Lekin 1839 me Ranjit Singh ki wafat ke baad Lahore darbar sazishon ka adda ban gaya, badshah badalte rahe, aur fouj beqabu hone lagi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Isi bechaini me pehli Anglo-Sikh jang 1845 me chiri. Mudki, Ferozeshah aur Sobraon ki sakht jangain hui. Sikh fouj ne zabardast muqabla kiya, lekin darbar ke andar ke ghadaron, khaas tor par Lal Singh aur Tej Singh ki badniyati ne unhe harwaya. Lahore muahide ke tehat company ne bhari tawan aur ilaqe liye. Lekin ye sakoon zyada dair na raha. 1848 me Multan me baghawat hui aur dusri Anglo-Sikh jang chir gayi. Chillianwala ki jang me company ko sakht nuqsan pohncha, lekin aakhir me Gujarat ki jang 1849 me Sikh fouj ne hathyar daal diye. Lord Dalhousie ne Punjab ko company ke ilaqon me shamil kar liya, aur naujawan Maharaja Duleep Singh ko takht se hata kar England bhej diya gaya. Koh-e-Noor heera bhi isi daur me Malika Victoria ke paas pohncha."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali khaas baat ye hai ke Punjab sab se aakhir me, 1849 me, angrezon ke qabze me aya. Yani Bengal 1757 me gaya aur Punjab 1849 me, takreeban sau saal ka ye safar hai jis me company ne poora barre-sagheer le liya."),
      LessonBlock.image("assets/learning/diagrams/history/punjab-lahore.jpg", caption: "Map — Punjab of the five rivers"),
      LessonBlock.heading("1857 ki Jang-e-Azadi"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab us jang ki baat jo is poore hisse ki sab se aham kahani hai. 1857 ki jang ko angrez baghawat kehte hain aur hum Jang-e-Azadi kehte hain, aur paper me ye sawal dono naamon ke sath aa sakta hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pehle wajah samjho, kyunke ye jang kisi aik din ka ghussa nahi thi. Sau saal ki company hukumat me zulm jama hota raha tha. Lord Dalhousie ki woh policy jis ke tehat jis riyasat ke badshah ka koi waaris na ho, wo riyasat company me mila li jati thi, is se Jhansi aur doosri riyasatain cheen li gayi thi. Nawab Wajid Ali Shah ko hata kar Awadh par qabza kar liya gaya tha, aur Awadh hi se sab se zyada sipahi company ki fouj me the. Maashi loot, mazhabi bechaini, aur sipahiyon ki kam tankhwah aur badsulooki ne aag tayyar kar di thi. Phir aakhri wajah wo naye kartoos bane jin ke baare me mashhoor hua ke un par gay aur khinzeer ki charbi lagi hai aur unhe daanton se kaatna parta hai. Hindu ke liye gay aur musalman ke liye khinzeer, dono ke mazhab par seedha hamla tha. Yehi wo chingari thi jo barood par ja giri."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Kahani ka aaghaz Barrackpore se hua jahan 29 March 1857 ko aik sipahi Mangal Pandey ne kartoos istemal karne se inkar karke angrez afsaron par hamla kar diya. Use phansi de di gayi, lekin aag phail chuki thi. 10 May ko Meerut ke sipahiyon ne baghawat ki, apne qaidi sathiyon ko churaya, aur Delhi ki taraf kuch kiya. Delhi me unhon ne barrey Mughal badshah, Bahadur Shah Zafar ko, jo us waqt laal qile me aik pension yafta badshah ki zindagi guzaar raha tha, apna rehnuma elaan kar diya. Ab ye baghawat aik jang-e-azadi ki shakal le chuki thi, kyunke us ke peeche aik badshah ka naam aa gaya tha."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Phir ye aag sheher sheher phaili. Delhi me maheenon muqabla raha. Lucknow me Begum Hazrat Mahal ne apne bete Birjis Qadr ko takht par bitha kar qiyadat ki aur residency ka muhasra tareekh me mashhoor hai. Kanpur me Nana Sahib peshwa ke waaris hone ke daaway ke sath uthe aur un ke sath Tantia Tope jaisa maahir salar tha. Jhansi me Rani Lakshmibai ne wo bahaduri dikhayi ke khud angrez afsaron ne un ki tareef ki, wo mardana libaas me ghore par sawaar ho kar larti thi aur 1858 me Gwalior ke qareeb larte hue shaheed hui. Bareilly, Jagdishpur aur doosre ilaqon me bhi muqabla hua, jahan Kunwar Singh jaise salar asy saal ki umar me larte rahe."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Phir jang kyun nakam hui, ye bhi samajhna zaroori hai kyunke paper me ye sawal aksar ata hai. Koi markazi qiyadat aur mushtarka mansuba nahi tha, har sheher apni jang lar raha tha. Punjab aur dakkan ki bari taqatoun ne angrez ka sath diya. Angrez ke paas taar, railway aur behtar top khana tha jo us ne fouj ko teezi se harkat dene me istemal kiya. Aur maqami sardaron ki ghadariyan bhi wohi purani kahani dohra gayin. September 1857 me Delhi dobara angrez ke paas chala gaya, Bahadur Shah Zafar ko girftar karke Rangoon jalawatan kar diya gaya jahan 1862 me un ka inteqal hua aur wohi dafan hue. 1858 ke aakhir tak muqabla khatam ho gaya."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Nateeja tareekhi tha. East India Company khatam kar di gayi. 1858 ke Act ke tehat Hindustan ki hukumat seedha Bartanvi takht, yani Crown ke paas chali gayi, aur Malika Victoria ka elaan jari hua jis me maqami logon ke mazhab me mudakhlat na karne ka wada kiya gaya. Mughal saltanat hamesha ke liye khatam ho gayi. Aur aik gehra nateeja ye bhi hua ke is jang ki yadein baad me azadi ki tehreekon ki buniyad bani. Paper wali khaas baatain aik sath jama kar lo: aakhri wajah charbi wale kartoos, pehli chingari Mangal Pandey Barrackpore, rehnuma Bahadur Shah Zafar, aur nateeja company ka khatma aur Crown ki hukumat 1858."),
      LessonBlock.image("assets/learning/diagrams/history/battle-delhi1857.jpg", caption: "Map — Delhi, heart of 1857"),
      LessonBlock.heading("Aakhir me saal-war tartib aik nazar me"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab poori kahani ko tartib se dohra lo, kyunke paper me aksar jangon ko tartib me lagane ya saal pehchanne ka sawal ata hai. 712 me Muhammad bin Qasim ne Sindh fatah kiya aur Sindh Bab-ul-Islam kehlaya. 1192 me Tarain ki dusri jang me Ghauri ne Prithviraj ko haraya aur Delhi ka raasta khula. 1526 me Panipat ki pehli jang me Babur ne top aur tulughma se Mughal saltanat ki buniyad rakhi. 1556 me Panipat ki dusri jang me Hemu ki ankh ke teer ne Akbar ka takht bacha liya. 1761 me Panipat ki teesri jang me Abdali jeeta lekin Maratha taqat hamesha ke liye toot gayi. 1757 me Plassey me Mir Jafar ki ghadari se Bengal gaya, aur gaur karo, Plassey saal ke hisab se teesri Panipat se pehle ati hai, 1757 pehle aur 1761 baad me, yehi tartib wala trap paper me lagta hai. 1764 me Buxar ki jeet se company ko diwani mili. 1799 me Tipu Sultan Seringapatam me shaheed hue. 1849 me Punjab company ke paas gaya. Aur 1857 me Jang-e-Azadi hui jis ke baad 1858 me company khatam aur Crown ki hukumat shuru ho gayi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aik aakhri mashwara ustad ki taraf se. Jangon ko alag alag ratne ke bajaye unhe aik zanjeer ki tarah yaad karo. Har jang pichli jang ke nateeje se nikalti hai. Plassey ne Buxar ko bulaya, Buxar ne diwani di, diwani ne taqat di, aur taqat ne 1857 ki wajahain paida ki. Jab zanjeer samajh aa jayegi to koi saal nahi bhoolega."),
    ],
  ),
  GeoTopic(
    id: "wars-1947-2026",
    title: "History: Pakistan ki Jangain aur Do Aalmai Jangain (1947 se 2026 tak)",
    subtitle: "Azadi ke baad ki jangain, un ki wajahain, aur duniya ko badal dene wale do aalmai takrao",
    portion: "history",
    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.heading("Ye hisa kyun zaroori hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("One paper me jahan purani jangain poochi jati hain, wahan Pakistan ki apni jangain us se bhi zyada poochi jati hain. 1965 ki jang kitne din chali, Tashkent muahida kab hua, 1971 me Simla muahida kin ke darmiyan hua, Kargil me Nishan-e-Haider kis kis ko mila, ye sawalat takreeban har paper me ghum phir kar ate hain. Aur sath me do aalmai jangain bhi, kyunke UNO aur League of Nations jaisi tanzimon ki buniyad inhi jangon se juri hai. Is hisse me hum pehle Pakistan ki jangain kahani ki tarah parhenge, phir do aalmai jangain. Har jang me wahi tartib hogi jo tumhe aadat ho gayi hai: wajah, maidan, salar, faisla kun lamha, nateeja, aur paper wali khaas baat."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Pehli jang, 1947 se 1948. Kashmir se shuru hone wali kahani"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pakistan bane hue abhi do maah hi hue the ke wo masla khara ho gaya jo aj tak hal nahi hua, Kashmir ka masla. Pehle ye samajh lo ke masla bana kesay. Taqseem ke waqt riyasaton ko ikhtiyar diya gaya tha ke wo Pakistan ya Bharat me se kisi aik ke sath ilhaq kar lain. Jammu-o-Kashmir aik musalman aksariyat wali riyasat thi, lekin wahan ka hukmaran Maharaja Hari Singh hindu tha. Wo dono se alag rehne ki koshish me waqt guzaar raha tha, aur riyasat ke musalman apne haq ke liye uth khare hue the."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("October 1947 me sarhad par qabaili logon ne Kashmir par hamla kiya aur wo teezi se Srinagar ki taraf barhne lage. Is par Maharaja ne Bharat se madad mangi, aur Bharat ne shart rakhi ke pehle ilhaq par dastakhat karo. Maharaja ne Bharat ke sath ilhaq ki dastaveez par dastakhat kar diye, aur is ke sath hi Bharti fouj hawai jahazon ke zariye Srinagar pohnch gayi. Yahan se Pakistan aur Bharat ki foujain pehli dafa amne saamne aa gayin. Larai pahari ilaqon me phail gayi, kabhi aik taraf aage barhti, kabhi dusri."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ye jang kisi faisla kun jeet ke baghair ruki. Bharat masla UNO le gaya, UNO ne qarardadain pass ki ke jung bandi ho aur phir rai shumari, yani plebiscite ke zariye Kashmir ke logon se un ki marzi poochi jaye. 1 January 1949 ko jung bandi ho gayi aur aik ceasefire line kheench di gayi, jis ke aik taraf Pakistan ke zair-e-intezam Azad Kashmir aur Gilgit-Baltistan aye aur dusri taraf Bharat ke zair-e-intezam ilaqa. Yaad rakho, baad me jo line LoC kehlayi, us ki buniyad yehi ceasefire line hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali khaas baat: pehli jang 1947 se 1948, wajah Kashmir ka ilhaq, jung bandi 1 January 1949, aur UNO ki qarardadain rai shumari ke baare me. Ye chaar nukte aik sath yaad kar lo."),
      LessonBlock.image("assets/learning/diagrams/history/kashmir-1947.jpg", caption: "Map — Kashmir and Srinagar"),
      LessonBlock.heading("1965 ki jang. 6 September ka din"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab wo jang jo har Pakistani bache ko school se yaad hoti hai. 1965 ki jang ka pas-e-manzar bhi Kashmir hi tha. April 1965 me Rann of Kutch ke ilaqe me aik chhoti jhadap ho chuki thi. Phir August 1965 me Operation Gibraltar ke tehat Kashmir ke andar karwai ki koshish hui, aur us ke baad Operation Grand Slam ke tehat Pakistani fouj Chamb aur Jaurian ke ilaqe me aage barhi aur Akhnoor ki taraf rukh kiya, jo Bharat ke liye aik aham raasta tha."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Phir 6 September 1965 ki subah wo hua jis ne is jang ko tareekh bana diya. Bharat ne been-ul-aqwami sarhad paar karke Lahore ki taraf teen taraf se hamla kar diya, aur ye hamla baghair kisi baqaida elaan-e-jang ke tha. Isi liye 6 September ko Pakistan me Youm-e-Difa, Defence Day, manaya jata hai, ke ye wo din hai jab dushman ne achanak hamla kiya aur poori qoum fouj ke sath khari ho gayi. Lahore ko bachane me BRB nehar, yani Bambawali-Ravi-Bedian canal, aik mazboot difai lakeer sabit hui. Wahga aur Burki ke mahaz par sakht muqablay hue."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Is jang ke do maidan hamesha yaad rakho. Pehla, Chawinda ka mahaz Sialkot ke qareeb, jahan tankon ki wo azeem larai hui jo dusri aalmai jang ke baad tankon ki sab se bari jangon me gini jati hai. Sainkron tank amne saamne the aur Pakistani fouj ne dushman ki paish qadmi wahi rok di. Dusra, Lahore ka mahaz, jahan Major Raja Aziz Bhatti ne Burki ke qareeb BRB nehar ke kinare paanch din tak apni company ke sath muqabla kiya aur 12 September ko shaheed hue. Unhe Nishan-e-Haider diya gaya, jo Pakistan ka sab se bara fouji aizaz hai. Isi jang me fazaon me M. M. Alam ka wo karnama bhi mashhoor hai jis me unhon ne aik minute se kam waqt me paanch Bharti jahaaz giraye, jo aik aalami record mana jata hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Jang kul sattara din chali. UNO ki mudakhlat aur aalami dabao par 23 September 1965 ko jung bandi ho gayi. Phir January 1966 me Soviet Union ki mezbani me Tashkent ka muahida hua, jahan Pakistan ke Sadr Ayub Khan aur Bharat ke Wazir-e-Azam Lal Bahadur Shastri ne dastakhat kiye aur dono foujain jang se pehle wali positionon par wapas chali gayin. Aik talkh baat ye bhi tareekh ka hissa hai ke Shastri ka inteqal Tashkent me hi muahide ke agle din dil ke dauray se ho gaya."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali khaas baatain jama kar lo: hamla 6 September ko Lahore par hua, jang 17 din chali, tankon ki azeem jang Chawinda me hui, Aziz Bhatti ko Nishan-e-Haider mila, aur Tashkent muahida 1966 me Ayub Khan aur Shastri ke darmiyan hua."),
      LessonBlock.image("assets/learning/diagrams/history/punjab-lahore.jpg", caption: "Map — Lahore and the 1965 front"),
      LessonBlock.heading("1971 ki jang. Mashriqi Pakistan ka alag hona"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ye Pakistan ki tareekh ka sab se talkh bab hai, aur paper me ye sawal bhi utni hi sanjeedgi se poocha jata hai. Pakistan ke do hisay the, Mashriqi Pakistan aur Maghribi Pakistan, jin ke darmiyan aik hazaar meel se zyada Bharti ilaqa tha. 1970 ke aam intekhabat me Mashriqi Pakistan ki jamat Awami League ko aksariyat mili, lekin iqtidar ki muntakli par ikhtilaf is had tak barha ke mamla talkhi aur phir fouji karwai tak pohnch gaya. Lakhon log ghar chor kar sarhad paar chale gaye, aur Bharat ne isi surat-e-haal me mudakhlat ka mauqa dekha."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("December 1971 me baqaida jang chir gayi. Bharat ne mashriqi mahaz par har taraf se paish qadmi ki aur us ki fouj Dhaka ki taraf barhne lagi, jab ke maghribi mahaz par bhi sakht jhadapen hui. Mashriq me ghera tang hota gaya, aur aakhir me 16 December 1971 ko Dhaka me Pakistani fouj ke mashriqi kamaan ke sarbarah ne hathyar daalne ki dastaveez par dastakhat kar diye. Is ke sath Mashriqi Pakistan alag ho kar Bangladesh ban gaya. Is jang me takreeban tiranway hazaar, yani 93,000 Pakistani fouji aur shehri Bharti qaid me chale gaye, jo dusri aalmai jang ke baad qaidioun ki sab se bari tadaad mani jati hai. Ye tadaad paper me bohat poochi jati hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Is ke baad July 1972 me Simla ka muahida hua, jahan Pakistan ke Sadr Zulfikar Ali Bhutto aur Bharat ki Wazir-e-Azam Indira Gandhi ne dastakhat kiye. Isi muahide me tay paya ke dono mulk apne masail do tarafah guftagu se hal karenge, aur Kashmir me jung bandi wali lakeer ko naya naam diya gaya, Line of Control, yani LoC. Gaur karo, 1949 wali ceasefire line hi 1972 me LoC kehlayi. Qaidion ki wapsi bhi batadreej isi muahide ke baad hui."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aur aik wazahat jo owner ki hidayat par yahan pakki kar lo: Pakistan aur Bharat ke darmiyan aakhri bari aur mukammal jang 1971 ki thi. Us ke baad jo hua, wo Kargil 1999 ki mahdood jang thi, jo sirf LoC ke aik makhsoos ilaqe tak mehdood rahi. Ye farq paper me aksar trap ban kar ata hai, is liye isay alag se zehen me rakho."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali khaas baatain: 16 December 1971 ko Dhaka me hathyar daale gaye, 93,000 qaidi, Simla muahida 1972 me Bhutto aur Indira Gandhi ke darmiyan, aur LoC ka naam isi muahide se bana."),
      LessonBlock.image("assets/learning/diagrams/history/dhaka-1971.jpg", caption: "Map — Dhaka"),
      LessonBlock.heading("Siachen, 1984. Duniya ka sab se uncha maidan-e-jang"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab aik aisi jang jo kisi sheher ya maidan me nahi, barf ke paharon me lari jati hai. Siachen aik glacier hai jo Karakoram ke pahari silsile me waqay hai aur us ki bulandi athara hazaar feet se zyada hai, jahan sardion me darja hararat manfi pachaas tak gir jata hai. 1984 me Bharat ne is ilaqe par qabza karne ke liye fouj utaari, aur jawab me Pakistan ne bhi apni positionain sambhal lein. Tab se dono mulkon ki foujain duniya ke sab se unche maidan-e-jang me amne saamne hain, jahan dushman se zyada khatra mausam aur bulandi se hota hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper me Siachen par sawal aye to ye do baatain pakki rakho: ye 1984 me shuru hua, aur ye duniya ka sab se uncha maidan-e-jang hai. Ye koi mukammal jang nahi, aik barfani mahaz hai jo aaj tak qayam hai."),
      LessonBlock.image("assets/learning/diagrams/history/siachen-1984.jpg", caption: "Map — Siachen, the highest battlefield"),
      LessonBlock.heading("Kargil ki jang, 1999. LoC ke paar mahdood takrao"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("1999 ki kahani aik ajab pas-e-manzar se shuru hoti hai. February 1999 me Bharat ke Wazir-e-Azam Atal Bihari Vajpayee bus par sawaar ho kar Lahore aye the aur Nawaz Sharif se dostana mulaqat hui thi, Lahore elaan jari hua tha. Kuch hi maheenon baad, May 1999 me, khabar ayi ke Kargil aur Dras ke ilaqe me LoC ke paar unchi chotion par kuch log positionain liye hue hain. Barf pighalne ke baad jab Bharti fouj apni sardion me khali ki hui chowkion par wapas gayi to muqabla shuru ho gaya."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ye muqabla LoC ke un unche paharon me hua jahan saans lena bhi mushkil tha. Pakistani moqif ye raha ke ye Kashmir ke mujahedeen ki karwai hai, jab ke Bharat ne isay baqaida darandazi qarar diya. Larai ki sab se mashhoor kahani Tiger Hill ki hai, wo unchi choti jis par qabza is poore muqable ki pehchan ban gaya. Isi jang me do Pakistani sipahiyon ne wo bahaduri dikhayi jis par unhe Nishan-e-Haider mila. Captain Karnal Sher Khan ne dushman ke muqable me akhri saans tak position sambhali, aur un ki bahaduri ki tareef khud mukhalif taraf se bhi hui. Havildar Lalak Jan ne bhi apni chowki ka difa karte hue shahadat pai. Dono ke naam Nishan-e-Haider ke sath paper me lazmi pooche jate hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ye jang aalami dabao ke baad khatam hui. July 1999 me Wazir-e-Azam Nawaz Sharif America gaye, President Clinton se mulaqat hui, aur Washington elaan ke baad wapsi ka amal shuru ho gaya. Kuch hi arse me mahaz khamosh ho gaya."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali khaas baatain: Kargil 1999 me LoC par hua, ye aik mahdood jang thi, Tiger Hill mashhoor choti hai, Karnal Sher Khan aur Lalak Jan ko Nishan-e-Haider mila, aur ye jang Lahore bus yatra aur Lahore elaan ke kuch maah baad hui. Aur dobara sun lo, aakhri mukammal jang 1971 thi, Kargil us ke baad ki mahdood jang hai."),
      LessonBlock.image("assets/learning/diagrams/history/kargil-1999.jpg", caption: "Map — Kargil"),
      LessonBlock.heading("Pehli Aalmai Jang, 1914 se 1918"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab Pakistan se nikal kar duniya ki taraf chalo, kyunke one paper me aalmai jangain bhi poochi jati hain. Pehli Aalmai Jang ki wajahain barson se jama ho rahi thi. Europe ki bari taqatain do hison me banti hui thi, hathiyaron ki daur lagi thi, aur har mulk doosre se aage nikalne ki koshish me tha. Phir aakhri wajah wo goli bani jo 28 June 1914 ko Sarajevo ke sheher me chali, jahan Austria-Hungary ke wali ahad Archduke Franz Ferdinand ko qatal kar diya gaya. Aik maah ke andar andar ittehadon ki zanjeer harkat me aa gayi aur Europe jang me doob gaya."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aik taraf Allies the, jin me France, Britain aur Russia shamil the, aur baad me America bhi 1917 me in ke sath aa mila. Dusri taraf Central Powers the, jin me Germany, Austria-Hungary aur Usmani saltanat shamil thi. Jang chaar saal chali, aur is ki pehchan khandaqon wali larai hai, jahan sipahi maheenon khemi hui khandaqon me beth kar chand gaz zameen ke liye larte rahe. Zehreeli gas aur tank isi jang me pehli dafa bare pemane par istemal hue. Crore ke qareeb log mare gaye."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Jang 11 November 1918 ko Germany ki shikast aur hathyar dalne par khatam hui. 1919 me Versailles ka muahida hua, jis me Germany par sakht shartein aur bhari tawan lagaya gaya. Isi jang ke baad duniya me aman qayam rakhne ke liye League of Nations naam ki tanzim banayi gayi. Aur hamare ilaqe ke liye sab se aham nateeja ye hua ke Usmani saltanat khatam ho gayi aur khilafat ka nizam bhi chand saalon me khatam ho gaya, jis ki lehar barre-sagheer ke musalmanon tak Khilafat tehreek ki surat me pohnchi thi, jo tum Pak Studies me parh chuke ho."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali khaas baatain: aakhri wajah Sarajevo me Ferdinand ka qatal, jang 1914 se 1918, Versailles muahida 1919, League of Nations isi ke baad bani, aur Usmani saltanat ka khatma."),
      LessonBlock.image("assets/learning/diagrams/history/europe-ww1.jpg", caption: "Map — Europe in the First World War"),
      LessonBlock.heading("Dusri Aalmai Jang, 1939 se 1945"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("League of Nations duniya ko dusri jang se na bacha saki. Versailles ki sakht shartein Germany me narazgi paida karti rahin, aur isi maahol me Adolf Hitler iqtidar me aya. Us ne muahide ki shartein torna shuru ki, ilaqe par ilaqa liya, aur aakhir me 1 September 1939 ko Germany ne Poland par hamla kar diya. Britain aur France ne Germany ke khilaf elaan-e-jang kar diya, aur duniya dusri dafa aalmai jang me chali gayi."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aik taraf Axis taqatain thi, Germany, Italy aur Japan. Dusri taraf Allies the, Britain, Soviet Union, aur baad me America. America is jang me tab aya jab December 1941 me Japan ne us ke bahri adday Pearl Harbor par achanak hamla kar diya. Ye hamla paper me bohat poocha jata hai. Jang Europe se Africa aur Asia tak phaili, aur ye tareekh ki sab se bari aur sab se tabah kun jang sabit hui, jis me croreon log mare gaye, sheher ke sheher malba ban gaye."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("1945 me Germany ki shikast se Europe ki jang khatam ho gayi, lekin Japan larta raha. Phir August 1945 me America ne Japan ke do shehron, Hiroshima aur Nagasaki par atom bomb giraye. Insani tareekh me ye pehla aur ab tak ka aakhri istemal hai jo jang me hua. Chand dinon me Japan ne hathyar daal diye aur 2 September 1945 ko dusri aalmai jang khatam ho gayi. Kul muddat chhe saal banti hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Is jang ka sab se bara nateeja ye hua ke duniya ne aik nayi aalami tanzim banayi. October 1945 me United Nations, yani UNO, qayam hua, taake aindah aisi jang na ho. League of Nations nakam ho chuka tha, UNO usi ki jagah aya. Ye karri yaad rakho: pehli jang ke baad League of Nations, dusri jang ke baad UNO. Paper me ye jora aksar sath poocha jata hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper wali khaas baatain: jang 1939 me Hitler ke Poland par hamle se shuru hui, Pearl Harbor 1941 par hamle ke baad America aya, Hiroshima aur Nagasaki par August 1945 me atom bomb giraye gaye, jang chhe saal chali, aur UNO 1945 me isi ke baad bana."),
      LessonBlock.image("assets/learning/diagrams/history/ww2-europe.jpg", caption: "Map — Europe in the Second World War"),
      LessonBlock.image("assets/learning/diagrams/history/ww2-pacific.jpg", caption: "Map — Japan and the Pacific, where the war ended"),
      LessonBlock.heading("Aakhir me saal-war tartib aik nazar me"),
      LessonBlock.image("assets/learning/diagrams/history/wars-timeline.jpg", caption: "Wars Timeline — 1947 to Kargil 1999"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab poori kahani ko tartib se dohra lo. 1947 se 1948 me pehli Pak-Bharat jang hui, 1 January 1949 ko jung bandi aur ceasefire line bani. 1965 me sattara din ki jang hui, 6 September ko Lahore par hamla Defence Day ki wajah bana, aur 1966 me Tashkent muahida hua. 1971 me 16 December ko Dhaka me hathyar daale gaye, Bangladesh bana, aur 1972 me Simla muahide se LoC ka naam para. 1984 me Siachen ka barfani mahaz khula. 1999 me Kargil ki mahdood jang hui. Aur aalmai jangon ki tartib yun hai: pehli 1914 se 1918, jis ke baad League of Nations bana. Dusri 1939 se 1945, jis ke baad UNO bana."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aik aakhri wazahat phir se sun lo, kyunke yehi is hisse ka sab se aham jumla hai. Pakistan aur Bharat ke darmiyan mukammal jangain teen hui, 1947 se 48, 1965 aur 1971. Us ke baad Kargil 1999 mahdood jang thi. Jab paper me poocha jaye ke aakhri bari jang kab hui to jawab 1971 hai. Jangon ko saalon ki jora bandi se yaad karo: 65 ke sath Tashkent 66, 71 ke sath Simla 72. Muahida hamesha jang ke agle saal ata hai, ye chhoti si trick tumhe kabhi saal nahi bhoolne degi."),
    ],
  ),
];
